  "type": "Click",
  "display_name": "Arctic Breath",
  "display_fullname": "Epic Guardian Leviathan Mastery Arctic Breath",
  "display_help": "Sharks will eat anything, so their stomach acid must be powerful indeed. You can regurgitate this freezing acid and spew a corrosive spray of bile at a foe. Affected foes in the cone area will take cold damage over time, and have their damage resistance, Defense, movement rate, and recharge rate reduced.  This ice will stick to foes, causing them to fall down occasionally.  Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Long",
